{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>擁有「台版三上悠亞」稱號女星林莎於11月16日突然在社交平台大派福利，公開多張於馬爾代夫度假極致性感照片。她身穿全白細肩帶比堅尼展現深邃事業線與纖細螞蟻腰，與早前宣布退出寫真界決定形成強烈對比。這種打破大眾預期極端反差畫面瞬間在網絡上掀起猛烈討論狂潮。</p>\n<h2>林莎深夜突發公開馬爾代夫火辣美照</h2>\n<p>林莎在社交媒體發布一系列充滿海島風情火辣美照，畫面中她一時背對鏡頭觀望無際大海，一時身體緊挨船邊並面露甜美燦爛笑容。她身上全白細肩帶比堅尼配搭布料極少泳褲，將豐滿上圍擠出深邃事業線，加上極度纖細螞蟻腰，將魔鬼身材展露無遺。這批照片完全符合熱帶度假氛圍，強烈視覺衝擊力令無數網民目光無法移開。</p>\n<h2>台版三上悠亞親自曝光潛水旅行動態</h2>\n<p>面對網絡上瞬間引爆熱烈討論，當事人選擇以輕鬆度假動態作進一步分享，未有直接回應性感照片引發震撼。她隨後在平台上曬出專業潛水裝備，並公開一段拍攝魔鬼魚在水中不斷翻滾嬉戲可愛影像。她透過帖文開心直呼「潛水旅行～〜馬爾代夫！」，向外界展現自己正全心投入享受同陽光玩遊戲悠閒度假時光。</p>\n<h2>昔日宣布退出寫真界令亞洲男士叫苦</h2>\n<p>被外界封為「台版三上悠亞」女星過去一直憑藉傲人身材與甜美外貌累積極高人氣，但她早前卻無預警宣布「着番衫」，正式決定最後一脫並退出寫真界。這個突如其來消息曾經令大批粉絲感到相當錯愕，更有不少亞洲男士對此大感惋惜並叫苦連天。外界原本以為以後難以再見到女神極度性感一面，未料今次馬爾代夫之旅竟再度大解放。</p>\n<h2>震撼畫面惹來大批網民瘋狂留言討論</h2>\n<p>這批極具視覺張力度假照片一經發布，隨即引發網絡輿論猛烈發酵，大批網民湧入社交平台瘋狂留言。對於女神罕有再次展露豐滿身材，有網民激動表示「林莎雪乳凸出，令人羨慕」以及「林莎身材有睇頭」。同時亦有粉絲留意到她豐富潛水行程，留言大讚「林莎仲去埋潛水，識玩」，整個留言區充斥對這次突破底線大解放熱烈討論。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489320712671385_18798681946afbe597d89ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489320712671385_18798681946afbe597d89ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489321000612500_14245511246afbe59a843fd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489321000612500_14245511246afbe59a843fd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932129945124_4613095666afbe59d589d9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932129945124_4613095666afbe59d589d9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932163615608_5068761836afbe5a0abed7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932163615608_5068761836afbe5a0abed7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322038989851_12416825546afbe5a4e2d38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322038989851_12416825546afbe5a4e2d38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322376660168_10853969366afbe5a827118.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322376660168_10853969366afbe5a827118.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322667135551_6228988636afbe5ab8a373.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322667135551_6228988636afbe5ab8a373.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322948952565_9574824096afbe5ae3e141.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489322948952565_9574824096afbe5ae3e141.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489323167940242_4007826416afbe5b01b20d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489323167940242_4007826416afbe5b01b20d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489323355821427_17124557346afbe5b21c363.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489323355821427_17124557346afbe5b21c363.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932357875906_3639019396afbe5b4476cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林莎 馬爾代夫 （圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948932357875906_3639019396afbe5b4476cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@superlisa821）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:03:25.630004+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1245,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T05:48:17.020301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:57:01.414289+00:00","content_hash":"ccfe8f2f5f8cca5084d5b5299572a289ea76c432739a2c3d0749b27b530b55ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}